            { text: "“If an area is contained by a rational straight line and a first apotome,",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["AB","AC","AD"],
              justifications: [{ ref: "X.91" }] },
            { text: "then the side of the area is an apotome.”",
              visible: ALL,
              highlighted: ["AB","LN"] },
            { text: "Let the area {AB} be contained by the rational straight line {AC} and the first apotome {AD}.",
